{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Welcome to Toy Town!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Toy Town, a toy has one goal, to be the last one standing in the shop, because the last toy standing, is always the best toy. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Need to practice first? Play the Free For All mode, all the toys in Toy Town are covered by top notch insurance, so that when a toy is damaged, they'll get fixed right up and will be ready for their next battle. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Done practicing and ready to be the best? Hop into the battle royale mode, where you will fight 9 other real players, to be the last toy standing!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What kinds of weapons and items will help you to win in Toy Town?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Toy Town has many things that will suit everybody's needs!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Rapid Rifle - Quick and Reliable Option<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3898800/extras/011167f10014372af249b4ea7f28d6ca.avif?t=1769623810\" width=262 height=202 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;<i>Rapid Rifle, the name doesn't do it enough justice!&quot; - Larry</i></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Supreme Shotgun - A Solid Shooter</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3898800/extras/d02412e49afad71698c80e1d48d2200b.avif?t=1769623810\" width=314 height=214 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;BLAM!! Well that's it! Finishes the job just like that!&quot; - Also Larry</i></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Bomb - Classic slapstick weapon</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3898800/extras/c2fa570389afeb5ddeacba8d5285f2f4.avif?t=1769623810\" width=430 height=356 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;Can't go wrong wit it!&quot; - Cowboy Jim</i></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fabulous Frankfurter</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3898800/extras/add7f5c99eb3a2124596a60ba7eb559a.avif?t=1769623810\" width=478 height=400 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;Great meal after a long day.&quot; - Skull Gang Greg</i></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More weapons are to come as Toy Town gains more residents!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >How about maps? Where can we fight?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Good questions! Toy Town currently has 3 locations where you can compete to be the best, with more on the way!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The MEGA MAP</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3898800/extras/3f172e03f5f7cd2d5f0d624be89e9123.avif?t=1769623810\" width=1600 height=744 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;Totally huge!&quot;</i></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cheese Room</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3898800/extras/526e6025ffa09feeb335bb38d031e7b9.avif?t=1769623810\" width=1600 height=792 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;Everything is made of CHEESE!&quot;</i></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Floating Plains</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3898800/extras/bd2fb19c228b7af05d17eac7b7dec08b.avif?t=1769623810\" width=1122 height=634 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;The first battle royale map! Islands fall overtime, don't fall with them!&quot;</i></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More maps will come as Toy Town has more time to renovate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >So what are you waiting for? Book a trip to Toy Town and enjoy the Mayhem!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Toy Town Rookie","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3898800/07bc82b707a254a0add5ce13c33d60e73c998b4e.jpg"},{"name":"Wake UP!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3898800/43f28e3910ef4fd33359d84e640b4b1cd5d2cca8.jpg"},{"name":"Welcome to Toy Town!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3898800/19aeebe51ab472bbfc967666bf5a6876b372c4bf.jpg"},{"name":"Delicious","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3898800/00f36419104d5618b162ec71b7ec9f1e4fa50dc2.jpg"},{"name":"Lookin' Sharp!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3898800/459cb391507da69c72dee10fb411bd500007eb06.jpg"},{"name":"Toy Town Everywhere!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3898800/9c4753e475e5efce89cc4e71c3e6ca52cec6b677.jpg"},{"name":"That's my name! Don't wear it out \ud83d\ude0f","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3898800/b98824efc033b9b91b060567e5fbbf0c921fc944.jpg"},{"name":"Toy 